WEBVTT

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:01.999
[Singing]

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:05.999
[Singing]

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:06.999
[Singing]

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:14.999
[Music]

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:19.999
[Singing]

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:27.999
Did you enjoy the concert?

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:30.999
Hi.

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:32.999
I'm back again

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:37.999
with another livestream.

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:40.999
You've been waiting a long time, haven't you, PLLI?

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:43.999
I was going to do this livestream--

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:46.999
this birthday stream--on my actual birthday,

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:47.999
but...

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:50.999
I couldn't because of the concert.

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:54.999
So today is September 17, right? Yes.

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:58.999
I've ended up starting this livestream

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:03.999
five whole days late.

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:06.999
I meant to do it on my birthday,

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:09.999
but the concert got in the way. Ah...

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:12.999
Still, we're going to have lots of fun today.

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:13.999
That's the plan.

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:16.999
My words are getting tangled already. Anyway,

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:20.999
I wanted to spend some quality time

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:23.999
alone with PLLI today,

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:24.999
so I prepared

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:25.999
quite a lot

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:27.999
for our time together. Ja, where are we?

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:30.999
At the beach.

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:35.999
I'm out here on the open sea.

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:37.999
Shouldn't PLLI come and rescue me?

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:44.999
I'm all alone here.

00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:46.999
The concert is to blame? No,

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:48.999
that's not it.

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:52.999
PLLI, why aren't you coming here?

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:55.999
Are you really going to leave me here alone?

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:58.999
There's even a fishing rod. You saw it earlier, right?

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:00.999
I have a fishing rod.

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:02.999
Yeah.

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:06.999
Shall I sit down?

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:08.999
Oof.

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:12.999
Let's sit here

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:16.999
and chat for a bit.

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:19.999
Don't jump into the ocean.

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:20.999
Jumping in to rescue me--

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:22.999
that...

00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:28.999
that would be a mistake. Yes.

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:30.999
Someone says the sound

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:32.999
seems a little quiet.

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:34.999
Yes, I'd appreciate it

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:36.999
if you could turn my voice up a little.

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:37.999
Ja, first we should talk

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:41.999
about the concert, right? On September...

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:45.999
September 12 and 13,

00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:49.999
PLAVE performed at Munhak Stadium--

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:52.999
the actual stadium--

00:05:53.000 --> 00:06:01.999
for our concert.

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:03.999
And...

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:05.999
so many PLLIs loved it

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:09.999
and cheered for us.

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:14.999
We performed for two days, but honestly,

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:16.999
it felt like twenty minutes. Seriously,

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:19.999
it flew by.

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:21.999
Ja, then I woke up on the morning of the 14th

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:23.999
and thought, 'Why aren't we doing

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:25.999
another concert today?'

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:27.999
That's how I felt. My voice suddenly got louder.

00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:29.999
Is the volume fluctuating?

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:33.999
Right.

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:35.999
Even on Monday I kept thinking,

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:38.999
'I want to perform again. I want to go back to yesterday,

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:40.999
back to the weekend.'

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:45.999
I thought that so often. How was it for you, PLLI?

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:48.999
It was amazing?

00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:51.999
What's this ring? This ring?

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:55.999
It's that ring. This is the ring.

00:06:56.000 --> 00:06:58.999
The one I wore

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:01.999
on September 12.

00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:05.999
If you're still wearing yours,

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:07.999
raise your hand

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:10.999
in the comments. Say you're still living at Munhak.

00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:13.999
There are so many PLLIs

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:16.999
who still haven't managed

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:21.999
to leave Munhak behind.

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:25.999
Then we have no choice but to do it again.

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:27.999
What do we do?

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:29.999
Yes. What can we do? We simply have

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:32.999
no choice but to do another one.

00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:36.999
I really don't know.

00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:38.999
Ja,

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:41.999
first...

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:43.999
there's a lot written on the prompter,

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:45.999
so I'll read through it one by one.

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:48.999
When were you the most nervous?

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:51.999
When was I the most nervous...?

00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:55.999
When the nerves really hit...

00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:57.999
Honestly, every performance makes me nervous.

00:07:58.000 --> 00:07:59.999
There isn't really a stage

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:03.999
that doesn't make me nervous.

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:07.999
I was nervous for 'The 6th Summer' because it was first,

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:09.999
the opening number.

00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:10.999
I was nervous for 'Close To You.'

00:08:11.000 --> 00:08:13.999
I really was.

00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:16.999
But I worked hard

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:21.999
to act as though I wasn't.

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:23.999
For the other performances,

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:25.999
I was together with all the members,

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:28.999
so even when I was very nervous,

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:31.999
we could share some of that tension.

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:39.999
Isn't that what a team is?

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:40.999
When the lift opened for 'Jun to You,'

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:43.999
I was really nervous.

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:45.999
And...

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:49.999
I was alone, and it wasn't

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:52.999
a fast-tempo song either.

00:08:53.000 --> 00:08:54.999
I really had to sing it,

00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:57.999
so I think I was quite nervous.

00:08:58.000 --> 00:09:00.999
But I focused on PLLI's

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:03.999
cheering

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:04.999
and...

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:08.999
all those sparkling lights.

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:11.999
Somehow, I made it through.

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:15.999
Okay. Did you like it, PLLI?

00:09:16.000 --> 00:09:18.999
Was it good?

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:22.999
I...

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:26.999
I worried it might not satisfy PLLI,

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:30.999
so I think I worked incredibly hard.

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:33.999
If PLLI liked it, that's enough for me.

00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:34.999
Two, three, ten--even a hundred times.

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:38.999
I could do it again and again.

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:39.999
Two, three, ten, a hundred more times--

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:42.999
I could practice more and perform it more.

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:47.999
I really could.

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:51.999
The comments are flooding in

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:58.999
saying you loved it.

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:02.999
Thank you so, so much. Ja, actually...

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:05.999
well...

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:07.999
there's something I'm curious about too.

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:11.999
Something I want to know.

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:13.999
I've watched a lot of the videos

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:15.999
that PLLI uploaded, even after the first day.

00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:18.999
And after the second day ended,

00:10:19.000 --> 00:10:20.999
I watched lots of clips

00:10:21.000 --> 00:10:24.999
to see how everything looked.

00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:31.999
Were those cricket sounds actually real?

00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:34.999
You really could hear crickets at Munhak Stadium.

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:39.999
The sounds of insects.

00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:42.999
We didn't add them ourselves.

00:10:43.000 --> 00:10:48.999
We really performed together with nature.

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:51.999
But they fit so perfectly.

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:54.999
I wondered whether the production team

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:57.999
or someone on the concert staff--

00:10:58.000 --> 00:10:59.999
maybe the sound director--

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:03.999
had added them

00:11:04.000 --> 00:11:05.999
to create more atmosphere.

00:11:06.000 --> 00:11:07.999
That's what I thought.

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:11.999
So they were there naturally.

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:14.999
It was wonderful.

00:11:15.000 --> 00:11:16.999
We got lucky with that.

00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:19.999
It was so good.

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:21.999
You could hear the insects

00:11:22.000 --> 00:11:27.999
the whole time.

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:29.999
That wasn't staged.

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:39.999
Nature handled the production for us. It was lovely.

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:40.999
Right? PLLI thought we'd added it too,

00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:42.999
didn't you?

00:11:43.000 --> 00:11:45.999
Munhak Stadium

00:11:46.000 --> 00:11:52.999
gave us a featured performance. Thank you.

00:11:53.000 --> 00:11:54.999
It was romantic?

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:57.999
And as for the sides of me

00:11:58.000 --> 00:11:59.999
that PLLI wants to see,

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:02.999
I'll keep researching and studying hard

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:06.999
to show you new sides of myself

00:12:07.000 --> 00:12:08.999
and lots of impressive things

00:12:09.000 --> 00:12:10.999
that I can do well.

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:12.999
I'll show you all of that,

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:22.999
so please come to our next concert too.

00:12:23.000 --> 00:12:25.999
First, we have our tour coming up--

00:12:26.000 --> 00:12:29.999
our world tour--so we'll work hard

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:35.999
and come back safely.

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:38.999
And you know when PLLI entered

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:40.999
and left the venue?

00:12:41.000 --> 00:12:42.999
We were actually watching all of it.

00:12:43.000 --> 00:12:48.999
How much did we see? Well...

00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:50.999
We watched you enter for the sound check,

00:12:51.000 --> 00:12:53.999
all of it.

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:56.999
And when you left,

00:12:57.000 --> 00:12:58.999
you exited section by section.

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:02.999
The people seated near the front

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:05.999
waited for a while

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:08.999
before leaving. We watched that too.

00:13:09.000 --> 00:13:14.999
Every bit of it.

00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:16.999
And when you had some time after entering,

00:13:17.000 --> 00:13:19.999
you took commemorative photos

00:13:20.000 --> 00:13:23.999
and selfies with the stage.

00:13:24.000 --> 00:13:27.999
We watched all of that.

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:30.999
We saw you hold up your slogans

00:13:31.000 --> 00:13:32.999
and snap photo after photo

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:39.999
with them too.

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:42.999
We see everything PLLI does.

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:43.999
[Laughs]

00:13:44.000 --> 00:13:53.999
[Laughs]

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:55.999
And to share a little

00:13:56.000 --> 00:13:57.999
behind-the-scenes story from Munhak Stadium:

00:13:58.000 --> 00:13:59.999
we actually went there the day before,

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:02.999
on the 11th.

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:05.999
Yes. We went ahead for rehearsal.

00:14:06.000 --> 00:14:08.999
Once we arrived,

00:14:09.000 --> 00:14:11.999
the dancers...

00:14:12.000 --> 00:14:15.999
we sat in the audience and watched them,

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:18.999
all the members sitting in the stands

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:21.999
and looking at the stage.

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:24.999
And the band--

00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:27.999
the session musicians--

00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:31.999
we listened to their rehearsal too,

00:14:32.000 --> 00:14:34.999
sitting in the audience.

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:39.999
It was so good.

00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:43.999
For a little while during rehearsal,

00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:47.999
we got to experience being PLLI.

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:50.999
And of course, we went up onstage

00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:53.999
and took photos together.

00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:55.999
Yes.

00:14:56.000 --> 00:14:57.999
We tried singing there too.

00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:04.999
That's what we did.

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:08.999
Which seat was it? Didn't I note it?

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:10.999
Well...

00:15:11.000 --> 00:15:13.999
I took a photo

00:15:14.000 --> 00:15:15.999
of the exact seat where I sat.

00:15:16.000 --> 00:15:16.999
But I don't think I should tell you.

00:15:17.000 --> 00:15:18.999
No.

00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:21.999
Let's keep that secret.

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:24.999
I'll tell you

00:15:25.000 --> 00:15:26.999
in about ten years.

00:15:27.000 --> 00:15:32.999
I'll release the photo in ten years.

00:15:33.000 --> 00:15:33.999
I took a photo of the seat

00:15:34.000 --> 00:15:37.999
where I was sitting. It had something like

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:42.999
a section and seat number written on it.

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:46.999
I wanted some keepsakes too.

00:15:47.000 --> 00:15:50.999
How often will I get to stand

00:15:51.000 --> 00:15:52.999
in a huge venue like Munhak?

00:15:53.000 --> 00:15:58.999
So I photographed everything I could commemorate.

00:15:59.000 --> 00:16:00.999
Anyway, that's what happened. Yes.

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:05.999
On my birthday, September 12,

00:16:06.000 --> 00:16:06.999
I received so many birthday wishes

00:16:07.000 --> 00:16:08.999
at the concert.

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:11.999
Seriously...

00:16:12.000 --> 00:16:13.999
I truly don't think

00:16:14.000 --> 00:16:15.999
I'll ever forget it.

00:16:16.000 --> 00:16:18.999
Ja, I've never heard

00:16:19.000 --> 00:16:20.999
so many people sing

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:24.999
'Happy Birthday' to me before.

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:29.999
How could I have?

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:33.999
Well...

00:16:34.000 --> 00:16:35.999
Among the members, Hamin's birthday

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:38.999
fell during a concert before too,

00:16:39.000 --> 00:16:42.999
didn't it? Right.

00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:44.999
Having a birthday during a concert

00:16:45.000 --> 00:16:47.999
really is a blessing

00:16:48.000 --> 00:16:54.999
for a singer. I was deeply moved.

00:16:55.000 --> 00:16:58.999
Thank you.

00:16:59.000 --> 00:17:00.999
Oh, right, right. And during 'Poo-TV'...

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:03.999
I can talk about the concert now,

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:05.999
can't I? I can discuss what happened,

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:08.999
right? Yes. During 'Poo-TV,'

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:12.999
at the end, Hamin said to me,

00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:15.999
'Happy birthday,'

00:17:16.000 --> 00:17:18.999
during his closing remarks.

00:17:19.000 --> 00:17:23.999
That adorable kid.

00:17:24.000 --> 00:17:25.999
I didn't expect

00:17:26.000 --> 00:17:27.999
that surprise birthday wish

00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:30.999
from our maknae.

00:17:31.000 --> 00:17:36.999
Thank you.

00:17:37.000 --> 00:17:38.999
Ja, so...

00:17:39.000 --> 00:17:42.999
we've had our concert chat,

00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:44.999
and to spend

00:17:45.000 --> 00:17:47.999
some more quality time with PLLI,

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:49.999
I prepared this yacht.

00:17:50.000 --> 00:17:52.999
You know yachts are

00:17:53.000 --> 00:17:53.999
extremely expensive, right?

00:17:54.000 --> 00:17:56.999
The rental fee is enormous.

00:17:57.000 --> 00:17:58.999
But I prepared one for us.

00:17:59.000 --> 00:18:01.999
I suppose this counts

00:18:02.000 --> 00:18:04.999
as showing off. Since it's my birthday,

00:18:05.000 --> 00:18:06.999
I decided to splurge

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:08.999
for PLLI.

00:18:09.000 --> 00:18:13.999
Ta-da.

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:16.999
Holding my birthday stream on the sea I love

00:18:17.000 --> 00:18:19.999
feels especially meaningful

00:18:20.000 --> 00:18:23.999
and refreshingly new.

00:18:24.000 --> 00:18:26.999
When I think of the sea...

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:29.999
honestly, I think of seafood.

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:31.999
The sea...

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:35.999
only makes me think of seafood.

00:18:36.000 --> 00:18:40.999
Have some blue crab these days.

00:18:41.000 --> 00:18:43.999
Blue crab should be in season now.

00:18:44.000 --> 00:18:46.999
Eat blue crab and shrimp,

00:18:47.000 --> 00:18:48.999
and...

00:18:49.000 --> 00:18:51.999
have some gizzard shad.

00:18:52.000 --> 00:18:54.999
Yes. I think

00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:57.999
that should cover it.

00:18:58.000 --> 00:19:00.999
You can also hear

00:19:01.000 --> 00:19:06.999
the sound of the ship's horn.

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:10.999
It's jumbo-shrimp season, right? Crustaceans...

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:13.999
Crustaceans are in season now.

00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:16.999
Eat plenty. Seasonal food

00:19:17.000 --> 00:19:19.999
is healthy and delicious,

00:19:20.000 --> 00:19:21.999
and comparatively affordable.

00:19:22.000 --> 00:19:25.999
It's great.

00:19:26.000 --> 00:19:26.999
I should take the members

00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:30.999
to the beach sometime.

00:19:31.000 --> 00:19:32.999
Once this busy period ends,

00:19:33.000 --> 00:19:34.999
I think we'll be given

00:19:35.000 --> 00:19:38.999
some time to travel.

00:19:39.000 --> 00:19:40.999
We'll take a trip then.

00:19:41.000 --> 00:19:42.999
We did go to the sea.

00:19:43.000 --> 00:19:45.999
I want to go again.

00:19:46.000 --> 00:19:46.999
I don't know whether the members

00:19:47.000 --> 00:19:48.999
are watching right now.

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:50.999
Are they practicing?

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:52.999
