01:26:43.000 --> 01:26:45.999
They already came and went,

01:26:46.000 --> 01:26:47.999
so perhaps there wasn't much left.

01:26:48.000 --> 01:26:50.999
Still, thank you for recording messages

01:26:51.000 --> 01:26:53.999
and writing me such

01:26:54.000 --> 01:26:56.999
very long letters.

01:26:57.000 --> 01:27:01.999
Ddu, I love you, PLLI.

01:27:02.000 --> 01:27:07.999
PLLI, I love you. Knock, knock... Ah!

01:27:08.000 --> 01:27:16.999
Ah!

01:27:17.000 --> 01:27:19.999
I'm scared.

01:27:20.000 --> 01:27:23.999
It feels like something is about to jump out.

01:27:24.000 --> 01:27:26.999
Where should I sit

01:27:27.000 --> 01:27:30.999
to protect my back?

01:27:31.000 --> 01:27:33.999
Should I do this?

01:27:34.000 --> 01:27:35.999
PLLI will watch my back

01:27:36.000 --> 01:27:38.999
from over here.

01:27:39.000 --> 01:27:39.999
I think I need to sit like this.

01:27:40.000 --> 01:27:40.999
It feels like something

01:27:41.000 --> 01:27:46.999
will leap out behind me.

01:27:47.000 --> 01:27:49.999
Ja, nothing else is coming out,

01:27:50.000 --> 01:27:52.999
right? Seriously.

01:27:53.000 --> 01:27:56.999
Ja, PLLI,

01:27:57.000 --> 01:28:12.999
keep a close eye on my tail.

01:28:13.000 --> 01:28:14.999
Ja.

01:28:15.000 --> 01:28:16.999
Ja, if something jumps out, I'll be

01:28:17.000 --> 01:28:19.999
scared again. I'm scared.

01:28:20.000 --> 01:28:21.999
Ja.

01:28:22.000 --> 01:28:24.999
Since it's getting quiet,

01:28:25.000 --> 01:28:29.999
I'll sing another song.

01:28:30.000 --> 01:28:34.999
For this one,

01:28:35.000 --> 01:28:38.999
I prepared a foreign-language song.

01:28:39.000 --> 01:28:39.999
It's by Zhou Shen sunbaenim:

01:28:40.000 --> 01:28:41.999
'Big Fish.'

01:28:42.000 --> 01:28:43.999
That's the song

01:28:44.000 --> 01:28:45.999
I prepared, but

01:28:46.000 --> 01:28:48.999
only the first verse.

01:28:49.000 --> 01:28:51.999
[Warms up voice]

01:28:52.000 --> 01:28:54.999
I'll give it a try.

01:28:55.000 --> 01:28:57.999
My throat is a little dry

01:28:58.000 --> 01:28:59.999
from all the talking,

01:29:00.000 --> 01:29:02.999
so please bear with me. I'll do my best.

01:29:03.000 --> 01:29:04.999
I hope

01:29:05.000 --> 01:29:07.999
PLLI likes it.

01:29:08.000 --> 01:29:28.999
Shall we begin?

01:29:29.000 --> 01:29:46.999
[Yejun sings in Chinese]

01:29:47.000 --> 01:29:59.999
[Yejun sings in Chinese]

01:30:00.000 --> 01:30:02.999
[Yejun sings in Chinese]

01:30:03.000 --> 01:30:04.999
[Yejun sings in Chinese]

01:30:05.000 --> 01:30:08.999
[Yejun sings in Chinese]

01:30:09.000 --> 01:30:10.999
[Yejun sings in Chinese]

01:30:11.000 --> 01:30:14.999
[Yejun sings in Chinese]

01:30:15.000 --> 01:30:32.999
[Yejun sings in Chinese]

01:30:33.000 --> 01:30:36.999
Ah! [Laughs]

01:30:37.000 --> 01:30:44.999
I gave it a try. Wow.

01:30:45.000 --> 01:30:47.999
Ja, so...

01:30:48.000 --> 01:30:48.999
Ah, singing is fun these days.

01:30:49.000 --> 01:30:51.999
It really is.

01:30:52.000 --> 01:30:52.999
Maybe it's because I practiced so much

01:30:53.000 --> 01:30:55.999
for the concert.

01:30:56.000 --> 01:30:56.999
Well done.

01:30:57.000 --> 01:31:04.999
I'll sing another song right away.

01:31:05.000 --> 01:31:05.999
Originally...

01:31:06.000 --> 01:31:09.999
well,

01:31:10.000 --> 01:31:12.999
when I sing on my birthday,

01:31:13.000 --> 01:31:15.999
I usually perform a few songs.

01:31:16.000 --> 01:31:19.999
But the schedule was so tight.

01:31:20.000 --> 01:31:21.999
I wondered whether

01:31:22.000 --> 01:31:25.999
I should sing songs I already know

01:31:26.000 --> 01:31:27.999
and love once more.

01:31:28.000 --> 01:31:30.999
But I thought it was right

01:31:31.000 --> 01:31:32.999
to sing something new for you,

01:31:33.000 --> 01:31:34.999
so I prepared several songs

01:31:35.000 --> 01:31:36.999
in a hurry.

01:31:37.000 --> 01:31:39.999
The next song

01:31:40.000 --> 01:31:42.999
is one I've sung before,

01:31:43.000 --> 01:31:45.999
but it suits this atmosphere,

01:31:46.000 --> 01:31:50.999
this weather,

01:31:51.000 --> 01:31:53.999
and those warm, swelling emotions

01:31:54.000 --> 01:31:59.999
we felt at Munhak.

01:32:00.000 --> 01:32:01.999
I wanted you to feel them

01:32:02.000 --> 01:32:04.999
once again,

01:32:05.000 --> 01:32:05.999
so although I've sung it before,

01:32:06.000 --> 01:32:08.999
I'll sing it again.

01:32:09.000 --> 01:32:14.999
It's 'Nanchun.'

01:32:15.000 --> 01:32:18.999
I simply wanted to sing it.

01:32:19.000 --> 01:32:20.999
After the Munhak concert,

01:32:21.000 --> 01:32:24.999
on Bubble, Weverse,

01:32:25.000 --> 01:32:30.999
and other communication apps...

01:32:31.000 --> 01:32:32.999
Sorry. I pressed the button while talking.

01:32:33.000 --> 01:32:36.999
I'm really sorry.

01:32:37.000 --> 01:32:39.999
You told me it was so much fun

01:32:40.000 --> 01:32:40.999
and gave you strength.

01:32:41.000 --> 01:32:44.999
That it moved you deeply,

01:32:45.000 --> 01:32:47.999
and that you cried a lot.

01:32:48.000 --> 01:32:51.999
So many of you said that.

01:32:52.000 --> 01:32:54.999
I was grateful and wanted

01:32:55.000 --> 01:32:56.999
to sing this song again.

01:32:57.000 --> 01:32:59.999
I think I mentioned before

01:33:00.000 --> 01:33:02.999
that this song also gave me strength.

01:33:03.000 --> 01:33:04.999
Because it did,

01:33:05.000 --> 01:33:07.999
I wanted to share those feelings

01:33:08.000 --> 01:33:11.999
I received back then.

01:33:12.000 --> 01:33:13.999
Ah...

01:33:14.000 --> 01:33:16.999
Shall we?

01:33:17.000 --> 01:33:17.999
Sorry.

01:33:18.000 --> 01:33:20.999
Wait a moment. [Laughs]

01:33:21.000 --> 01:33:23.999
Singing right after talking

01:33:24.000 --> 01:33:25.999
is really difficult. Concerts aren't

01:33:26.000 --> 01:33:27.999
like that. At a concert, it's song after song,

01:33:28.000 --> 01:33:30.999
so it's fine.

01:33:31.000 --> 01:33:33.999
Hmm. One moment.

01:33:34.000 --> 01:33:40.999
I'll try.

01:33:41.000 --> 01:33:56.999
Please just enjoy it.

01:33:57.000 --> 01:33:59.999
Ah, I'm sorry.

01:34:00.000 --> 01:34:01.999
I...

01:34:02.000 --> 01:34:04.999
I misheard the cue.

01:34:05.000 --> 01:34:08.999
Ah, that's not it.

01:34:09.000 --> 01:34:11.999
It's the guitar cue, but I'll start here.

01:34:12.000 --> 01:34:15.999
Please give it to me again.

01:34:16.000 --> 01:34:18.999
That was my mistake.

01:34:19.000 --> 01:34:40.999
Here we go.

01:34:41.000 --> 01:34:45.999
[Yejun sings]

01:34:46.000 --> 01:34:49.999
[Yejun sings]

01:34:50.000 --> 01:34:53.999
[Yejun sings]

01:34:54.000 --> 01:34:57.999
[Yejun sings]

