[Yejun sings]

01:35:36.000 --> 01:35:38.999
[Yejun sings]

01:35:39.000 --> 01:35:43.999
[Yejun sings]

01:35:44.000 --> 01:35:47.999
[Yejun sings]

01:35:48.000 --> 01:35:50.999
[Yejun sings]

01:35:51.000 --> 01:35:54.999
[Yejun sings]

01:35:55.000 --> 01:36:40.999
[Yejun sings]

01:36:41.000 --> 01:36:44.999
[Yejun sings]

01:36:45.000 --> 01:36:51.999
[Yejun sings]

01:36:52.000 --> 01:36:54.999
[Yejun sings]

01:36:55.000 --> 01:37:01.999
[Yejun sings]

01:37:02.000 --> 01:37:05.999
[Yejun sings]

01:37:06.000 --> 01:37:11.999
[Yejun sings]

01:37:12.000 --> 01:37:17.999
[Yejun sings]

01:37:18.000 --> 01:38:05.999
[Yejun sings]

01:38:06.000 --> 01:38:11.999
Thank you.

01:38:12.000 --> 01:38:15.999
PLLI, I'll do better.

01:38:16.000 --> 01:38:18.999
I'll do better. I promise.

01:38:19.000 --> 01:38:20.999
Ja, let's sit down

01:38:21.000 --> 01:38:25.999
and talk for a while.

01:38:26.000 --> 01:38:31.999
Ja.

01:38:32.000 --> 01:38:47.999
Want a drink, PLLI?

01:38:48.000 --> 01:38:48.999
Shouldn't the members be calling

01:38:49.000 --> 01:38:50.999
around now?

01:38:51.000 --> 01:38:54.999
It feels

01:38:55.000 --> 01:38:56.999
like a call should be coming.

01:38:57.000 --> 01:38:59.999
Ja, now that it's nighttime,

01:39:00.000 --> 01:39:02.999
it's getting a little cold,

01:39:03.000 --> 01:39:04.999
so I'll put on long sleeves.

01:39:05.000 --> 01:39:07.999
Ja, I'll change clothes.

01:39:08.000 --> 01:39:12.999
One, two, three.

01:39:13.000 --> 01:39:15.999
It's been a while, hasn't it?

01:39:16.000 --> 01:39:19.999
[Yejun sings]

01:39:20.000 --> 01:39:22.999
[Yejun sings]

01:39:23.000 --> 01:39:24.999
[Yejun sings]

01:39:25.000 --> 01:39:26.999
[Yejun sings]

01:39:27.000 --> 01:39:32.999
[Yejun sings]

01:39:33.000 --> 01:39:35.999
You haven't forgotten Munhak already, have you?

01:39:36.000 --> 01:39:40.999
I sang that there.

01:39:41.000 --> 01:39:43.999
Ja.

01:39:44.000 --> 01:39:45.999
It sounds like a call is coming in.

01:39:46.000 --> 01:39:52.999
One moment.

01:39:53.000 --> 01:39:54.999
[Yejun sings]

01:39:55.000 --> 01:39:56.999
[Yejun sings]

01:39:57.000 --> 01:40:05.999
[Yejun sings]

01:40:06.000 --> 01:40:12.999
Who is this?

01:40:13.000 --> 01:40:15.999
Who is this? [Singing]

01:40:16.000 --> 01:40:24.999
[Yejun sings]

01:40:25.000 --> 01:40:26.999
It looks like an incoming call.

01:40:27.000 --> 01:40:50.999
Ah.

01:40:51.000 --> 01:40:51.999
Hello?

01:40:52.000 --> 01:40:52.999
Nice to see you.

01:40:53.000 --> 01:40:54.999
You startled me.

01:40:55.000 --> 01:40:55.999
Good to see you.

01:40:56.000 --> 01:40:57.999
Oh. That wasn't you earlier, was it?

01:40:58.000 --> 01:40:59.999
It was someone else, right?

01:41:00.000 --> 01:41:01.999
What do you mean? Someone sounded drunk

01:41:02.000 --> 01:41:02.999
and started singing, so I ended the call.

01:41:03.000 --> 01:41:03.999
Really?

01:41:04.000 --> 01:41:04.999
Yeah.

01:41:05.000 --> 01:41:07.999
Something like that happened?

01:41:08.000 --> 01:41:08.999
Yeah.

01:41:09.000 --> 01:41:10.999
Right.

01:41:11.000 --> 01:41:12.999
The call...

01:41:13.000 --> 01:41:13.999
You know I had to call.

01:41:14.000 --> 01:41:16.999
Of course. The fans all know

01:41:17.000 --> 01:41:17.999
the routine by now.

01:41:18.000 --> 01:41:19.999
They were probably thinking,

01:41:20.000 --> 01:41:21.999
'The call should come around now.'

01:41:22.000 --> 01:41:22.999
Exactly.

01:41:23.000 --> 01:41:24.999
We were together

01:41:25.000 --> 01:41:25.999
until a few minutes ago,

01:41:26.000 --> 01:41:26.999
yes,

01:41:27.000 --> 01:41:28.999
but I called you anyway.

01:41:29.000 --> 01:41:30.999
Right. It's become

01:41:31.000 --> 01:41:31.999
part of the schedule.

01:41:32.000 --> 01:41:34.999
Yes. I hope you take it

01:41:35.000 --> 01:41:36.999
as my way of joining

01:41:37.000 --> 01:41:37.999
the broadcast. Yes.

01:41:38.000 --> 01:41:40.999
But today isn't actually your birthday.

01:41:41.000 --> 01:41:42.999
Right. My birthday has passed.

01:41:43.000 --> 01:41:45.999
Then why are you pretending it is today?

01:41:46.000 --> 01:41:48.999
I'm sorry.

01:41:49.000 --> 01:41:50.999
Yes, my apologies.

01:41:51.000 --> 01:41:51.999
Anyway...

01:41:52.000 --> 01:41:53.999
happy birthday once again.

01:41:54.000 --> 01:41:55.999
I'm rather envious

01:41:56.000 --> 01:41:57.999
that you got two birthdays.

01:41:58.000 --> 01:41:59.999
Right. I was lucky enough

01:42:00.000 --> 01:42:00.999
to celebrate at the concert

01:42:01.000 --> 01:42:03.999
and then hold this birthday stream

01:42:04.000 --> 01:42:05.999
on September 17 too.

01:42:06.000 --> 01:42:08.999
Exactly. That isn't easy to arrange,

01:42:09.000 --> 01:42:10.999
but Yejun made it possible.

01:42:11.000 --> 01:42:13.999
Ah, there was so much

01:42:14.000 --> 01:42:14.999
to prepare.

01:42:15.000 --> 01:42:15.999
Yes.

01:42:16.000 --> 01:42:16.999
As someone who watched from nearby...

01:42:17.000 --> 01:42:18.999
Yes.

01:42:19.000 --> 01:42:20.999
our very sensitive Ye...

01:42:21.000 --> 01:42:21.999
Indeed.

01:42:22.000 --> 01:42:25.999
These days Yejun is 'Ye-min.'

01:42:26.000 --> 01:42:28.999
Written in hanja:

01:42:29.000 --> 01:42:29.999
Ye for 'sensitive'...

01:42:30.000 --> 01:42:30.999
Yes.

01:42:31.000 --> 01:42:31.999
and jun for 'prepare.'

01:42:32.000 --> 01:42:34.999
Ah, preparing sensitively. Yes.

01:42:35.000 --> 01:42:36.999
You prepared very sensitively.

01:42:37.000 --> 01:42:38.999
Sensitively, yes.

01:42:39.000 --> 01:42:40.999
I wanted to tell you

01:42:41.000 --> 01:42:41.999
how impressive the entire process was.

01:42:42.000 --> 01:42:43.999
Thank you.

01:42:44.000 --> 01:42:46.999
Is that praise sufficient?

01:42:47.000 --> 01:42:49.999
Yes. I'm satisfied.

01:42:50.000 --> 01:42:51.999
I couldn't watch the stream.

01:42:52.000 --> 01:42:54.999
Did you use the fishing rod?

01:42:55.000 --> 01:42:56.999
Yes, I used it well.

01:42:57.000 --> 01:42:57.999
Did it work without problems?

01:42:58.000 --> 01:42:59.999
Yes. I caught an octopus.

01:43:00.000 --> 01:43:01.999
What a relief.

01:43:02.000 --> 01:43:04.999
And two pieces of seaweed.

01:43:05.000 --> 01:43:06.999
I spoiled it earlier, though.

01:43:07.000 --> 01:43:07.999
Yes.

01:43:08.000 --> 01:43:10.999
But earlier,

01:43:11.000 --> 01:43:11.999
I felt a little flustered.

01:43:12.000 --> 01:43:12.999
And disappointed.

01:43:13.000 --> 01:43:13.999
About what?

01:43:14.000 --> 01:43:15.999
Your aegyo was a little disappointing.

01:43:16.000 --> 01:43:17.999
Are you asking for another round

01:43:18.000 --> 01:43:19.999
of aegyo? Please do it.

01:43:20.000 --> 01:43:22.999
Yes. This time,

01:43:23.000 --> 01:43:25.999
do it properly.

01:43:26.000 --> 01:43:27.999
Everyone,

01:43:28.000 --> 01:43:29.999
guess who I am.

01:43:30.000 --> 01:43:31.999
Who came

01:43:32.000 --> 01:43:36.999
from ASTERUM?

01:43:37.000 --> 01:43:40.999
Guess who's back.

01:43:41.000 --> 01:43:43.999
That's all.

01:43:44.000 --> 01:43:48.999
Ah...

01:43:49.000 --> 01:43:50.999
I really wanted to try that

01:43:51.000 --> 01:43:51.999
over the phone.

01:43:52.000 --> 01:43:52.999
Yes, yes.

01:43:53.000 --> 01:43:55.999
Ah. Well, that was certainly...

01:43:56.000 --> 01:43:56.999
Yes.

01:43:57.000 --> 01:43:58.999
Your determination

01:43:59.000 --> 01:44:01.999
was very clear,

01:44:02.000 --> 01:44:02.999
so I'll give you a passing grade.

01:44:03.000 --> 01:44:03.999
My face has turned red

01:44:04.000 --> 01:44:04.999
while I'm sitting here alone.

01:44:05.000 --> 01:44:05.999
Yes.

01:44:06.000 --> 01:44:06.999
This is deeply painful.

01:44:07.000 --> 01:44:07.999
Yes.

01:44:08.000 --> 01:44:10.999
Anyway, let me offer

01:44:11.000 --> 01:44:11.999
my congratulations again.

01:44:12.000 --> 01:44:12.999
Yes.

01:44:13.000 --> 01:44:14.999
And for PLLI, it hasn't even been

01:44:15.000 --> 01:44:15.999
a full week

01:44:16.000 --> 01:44:16.999
since the concert ended.

01:44:17.000 --> 01:44:19.999
Right? The afterglow

01:44:20.000 --> 01:44:23.999
must still be strong.

01:44:24.000 --> 01:44:26.999
Perhaps you can share it

01:44:27.000 --> 01:44:29.999
with Yejun like this

01:44:30.000 --> 01:44:31.999
and let it linger a little longer.

01:44:32.000 --> 01:44:34.999
That's my quiet suggestion.

01:44:35.000 --> 01:44:36.999
That was such a lovely thing

01:44:37.000 --> 01:44:39.999
to say. PLLI is commenting

01:44:40.000 --> 01:44:41.999
that they love it,

01:44:42.000 --> 01:44:43.999
that it was moving,

01:44:44.000 --> 01:44:46.999
and that the afterglow remains.

01:44:47.000 --> 01:44:47.999
They're saying that now.

01:44:48.000 --> 01:44:50.999
I'm glad. Are you not getting seasick?

01:44:51.000 --> 01:44:52.999
Seasick?

01:44:53.000 --> 01:44:53.999
Yes.

01:44:54.000 --> 01:44:55.999
No, I don't get seasick.

01:44:56.000 --> 01:44:58.999
I suppose it would be strange if you did.

01:44:59.000 --> 01:45:00.999
Why?

01:45:01.000 --> 01:45:02.999
You've been on the boat for a long time.

01:45:03.000 --> 01:45:04.999
Yes. About an hour and forty-five minutes

01:45:05.000 --> 01:45:06.999
so far, and I'm still fine.

01:45:07.000 --> 01:45:09.999
Understood.

01:45:10.000 --> 01:45:11.999
I hope you enjoy the rest of your time.

01:45:12.000 --> 01:45:12.999
Yes.

01:45:13.000 --> 01:45:15.999
And PLLI,

01:45:16.000 --> 01:45:17.999
the weather is getting quite chilly.

01:45:18.000 --> 01:45:19.999
This is when you need to be careful.

01:45:20.000 --> 01:45:22.999
Yejun-hyung is actually

01:45:23.000 --> 01:45:23.999
showing signs of a cold.

01:45:24.000 --> 01:45:25.999
Right? So I hope everyone,

01:45:26.000 --> 01:45:28.999
including Yejun-hyung,

01:45:29.000 --> 01:45:29.999
stays healthy. I'll leave you with that.

01:45:30.000 --> 01:45:31.999
Yes.

01:45:32.000 --> 01:45:33.999
You may go now.

01:45:34.000 --> 01:45:34.999
All right.

01:45:35.000 --> 01:45:37.999
And...

01:45:38.000 --> 01:45:38.999
I love you.

01:45:39.000 --> 01:45:40.999
Yeah.

01:45:41.000 --> 01:45:42.999
Thank you.

01:45:43.000 --> 01:45:45.999
All right. Then, with love...

01:45:46.000 --> 01:45:46.999
Yeah.

01:45:47.000 --> 01:45:48.999
No, stop, stop.

