01:58:52.000 --> 01:58:53.999
That's where we are now.

01:58:54.000 --> 01:58:55.999
We swim in different waters.

01:58:56.000 --> 01:58:58.999
I'm warning you in advance, hyung.

01:58:59.000 --> 01:59:00.999
You've advanced to the big leagues.

01:59:01.000 --> 01:59:01.999
Right. And hyung was beside

01:59:02.000 --> 01:59:02.999
the big sea earlier.

01:59:03.000 --> 01:59:04.999
Right, right.

01:59:05.000 --> 01:59:05.999
I'm still on the big sea.

01:59:06.000 --> 01:59:07.999
Yes, you're there now.

01:59:08.000 --> 01:59:09.999
Hyung may be on the big sea,

01:59:10.000 --> 01:59:11.999
but...

01:59:12.000 --> 01:59:14.999
reaching our level of the big leagues

01:59:15.000 --> 01:59:16.999
may still be difficult.

01:59:17.000 --> 01:59:19.999
I'll check that tomorrow.

01:59:20.000 --> 01:59:21.999
Please do. Anyway,

01:59:22.000 --> 01:59:24.999
PLLI, Yejun-hyung has been

01:59:25.000 --> 01:59:28.999
working incredibly hard lately.

01:59:29.000 --> 01:59:31.999
The concert just ended.

01:59:32.000 --> 01:59:33.999
The Munhak concert only just finished,

01:59:34.000 --> 01:59:37.999
but he prepared this stream too.

01:59:38.000 --> 01:59:40.999
Between concert preparation

01:59:41.000 --> 01:59:43.999
and everything else we're doing,

01:59:44.000 --> 01:59:45.999
I hope PLLI tells Yejun-hyung

01:59:46.000 --> 01:59:49.999
how hard he worked and thanks him

01:59:50.000 --> 01:59:50.999
with lots of kind words today.

01:59:51.000 --> 01:59:51.999
Thank you. Truly.

01:59:52.000 --> 01:59:53.999
Seriously,

01:59:54.000 --> 01:59:55.999
hyung worked harder

01:59:56.000 --> 01:59:58.999
than you can imagine.

01:59:59.000 --> 02:00:01.999
I'm so proud of him and think he's amazing.

02:00:02.000 --> 02:00:04.999
I want to applaud Yejun-hyung

02:00:05.000 --> 02:00:05.999
for accomplishing it all.

02:00:06.000 --> 02:00:16.999
Thank you. Really, thank you.

02:00:17.000 --> 02:00:17.999
I love you.

02:00:18.000 --> 02:00:20.999
A round of applause...

02:00:21.000 --> 02:00:23.999
and seagull applause. Thank you.

02:00:24.000 --> 02:00:25.999
Thank you. [Imitates seagulls]

02:00:26.000 --> 02:00:27.999
Okay, okay.

02:00:28.000 --> 02:00:31.999
Yes. Thank you. I love you.

02:00:32.000 --> 02:00:34.999
Hyung, have a wonderful time today.

02:00:35.000 --> 02:00:36.999
I hope being with PLLI

02:00:37.000 --> 02:00:39.999
helps you recover from all that hard work.

02:00:40.000 --> 02:00:42.999
Okay. Thank you.

02:00:43.000 --> 02:00:43.999
Hyung, I love you.

02:00:44.000 --> 02:00:46.999
Tell PLLI

02:00:47.000 --> 02:00:47.999
you love them often.

02:00:48.000 --> 02:00:50.999
Good. Okay.

02:00:51.000 --> 02:00:56.999
[Playful farewell noises]

02:00:57.000 --> 02:01:01.999
Ah.

02:01:02.000 --> 02:01:05.999
That may appear in my dreams.

02:01:06.000 --> 02:01:07.999
Oh, my.

02:01:08.000 --> 02:01:10.999
Our PLLI fell asleep.

02:01:11.000 --> 02:01:12.999
PLLI is still here

02:01:13.000 --> 02:01:14.999
on the screen,

02:01:15.000 --> 02:01:15.999
so call quickly.

02:01:16.000 --> 02:01:21.999
If you're watching the stream,

02:01:22.000 --> 02:01:23.999
PLLI must be waiting right now too.

02:01:24.000 --> 02:01:26.999
Right? Yeah.

02:01:27.000 --> 02:01:30.999
Ja, while I wait,

02:01:31.000 --> 02:01:32.999
I'll hold our PLLI...

02:01:33.000 --> 02:01:34.999
What should I call this friend?

02:01:35.000 --> 02:01:36.999
A PLLI balloon? PLLI?

02:01:37.000 --> 02:01:38.999
What should it be?

02:01:39.000 --> 02:01:41.999
PLLI bubble.

02:01:42.000 --> 02:01:44.999
I'll hold the PLLI soap bubble

02:01:45.000 --> 02:01:48.999
like this for a while.

02:01:49.000 --> 02:01:50.999
Like this.

02:01:51.000 --> 02:01:56.999
Yes.

02:01:57.000 --> 02:02:07.999
Five seconds? Five, four, three, two, one. Time.

02:02:08.000 --> 02:02:10.999
No call.

02:02:11.000 --> 02:02:13.999
Ah.

02:02:14.000 --> 02:02:15.999
Oh, right. I haven't shown you

02:02:16.000 --> 02:02:18.999
that I have my cake. Remember

02:02:19.000 --> 02:02:22.999
my cake at Munhak?

02:02:23.000 --> 02:02:24.999
Ja, I brought it.

02:02:25.000 --> 02:02:26.999
I took it home,

02:02:27.000 --> 02:02:28.999
kept it safely in the fridge,

02:02:29.000 --> 02:02:31.999
and brought it to show you again today.

02:02:32.000 --> 02:02:35.999
Here it is. Ta-da.

02:02:36.000 --> 02:02:43.999
Isn't it pretty?

02:02:44.000 --> 02:02:45.999
Oh, they're hearts.

02:02:46.000 --> 02:02:50.999
It has four hearts like this.

02:02:51.000 --> 02:02:52.999
Ta-da.

02:02:53.000 --> 02:03:03.999
When I blow, the candle goes out.

02:03:04.000 --> 02:03:05.999
I can relight it with magic.

02:03:06.000 --> 02:03:13.999
One, two, three.

02:03:14.000 --> 02:03:15.999
This is what you call

02:03:16.000 --> 02:03:20.999
an alien.

02:03:21.000 --> 02:03:23.999
Ja.

02:03:24.000 --> 02:03:26.999
I'll put the cake back here

02:03:27.000 --> 02:03:32.999
and sit down.

02:03:33.000 --> 02:03:36.999
If no one calls, shall I sing?

02:03:37.000 --> 02:03:39.999
Want another song?

02:03:40.000 --> 02:03:43.999
What should I do?

02:03:44.000 --> 02:03:46.999
Which song?

02:03:47.000 --> 02:03:49.999
Can you just search for it

02:03:50.000 --> 02:03:52.999
on YouTube?

02:03:53.000 --> 02:03:56.999
Then I'll sing something I've done before.

02:03:57.000 --> 02:03:59.999
How about 'An Old Song'?

02:04:00.000 --> 02:04:03.999
Do you have an MR of Kim Dong-ryul's song

02:04:04.000 --> 02:04:07.999
with the melody removed?

02:04:08.000 --> 02:04:12.999
PLLI loves hearing me sing most,

02:04:13.000 --> 02:04:14.999
so... melody removed, yes.

02:04:15.000 --> 02:04:17.999
That one. Use that.

02:04:18.000 --> 02:04:22.999
We'll wait while I sing.

02:04:23.000 --> 02:04:29.999
Yes.

