02:12:30.000 --> 02:12:34.999
Hello?

02:12:35.000 --> 02:12:35.999
Yes.

02:12:36.000 --> 02:12:38.999
Yejun, did you believe?

02:12:39.000 --> 02:12:40.999
Believe what?

02:12:41.000 --> 02:12:41.999
Yes.

02:12:42.000 --> 02:12:44.999
What was I supposed to believe?

02:12:45.000 --> 02:12:46.999
Did you believe in Yejun?

02:12:47.000 --> 02:12:49.999
Ah, that I believed.

02:12:50.000 --> 02:12:51.999
I believed you would

02:12:52.000 --> 02:12:53.999
call like this.

02:12:54.000 --> 02:12:55.999
PLLI really wanted

02:12:56.000 --> 02:12:57.999
to hear Noah's voice.

02:12:58.000 --> 02:12:58.999
Really?

02:12:59.000 --> 02:13:00.999
Yes.

02:13:01.000 --> 02:13:01.999
Hi, PLLI.

02:13:02.000 --> 02:13:04.999
Noah called

02:13:05.000 --> 02:13:08.999
to wish me a happy birthday.

02:13:09.000 --> 02:13:09.999
Of course I should. Thank you.

02:13:10.000 --> 02:13:10.999
But...

02:13:11.000 --> 02:13:13.999
I already saw and congratulated you earlier.

02:13:14.000 --> 02:13:15.999
Today isn't your birthday.

02:13:16.000 --> 02:13:18.999
It isn't, right?

02:13:19.000 --> 02:13:21.999
Still... Oh, thank you.

02:13:22.000 --> 02:13:22.999
But don't pretend

02:13:23.000 --> 02:13:23.999
today is your birthday.

02:13:24.000 --> 02:13:26.999
Okay, okay.

02:13:27.000 --> 02:13:29.999
I did congratulate you.

02:13:30.000 --> 02:13:31.999
I did.

02:13:32.000 --> 02:13:32.999
You already did it so lavishly.

02:13:33.000 --> 02:13:35.999
Right. I've heard so many birthday wishes,

02:13:36.000 --> 02:13:36.999
including from the members.

02:13:37.000 --> 02:13:38.999
That's right.

02:13:39.000 --> 02:13:40.999
We already celebrated you plenty

02:13:41.000 --> 02:13:43.999
among ourselves.

02:13:44.000 --> 02:13:46.999
Today is for Yejun and PLLI

02:13:47.000 --> 02:13:48.999
to have the birthday celebration

02:13:49.000 --> 02:13:49.999
the concert prevented.

02:13:50.000 --> 02:13:51.999
Right, right.

02:13:52.000 --> 02:13:52.999
A day to make memories together.

02:13:53.000 --> 02:13:54.999
Exactly. We had a great time.

02:13:55.000 --> 02:13:58.999
Today, out here on the boat,

02:13:59.000 --> 02:14:00.999
I went fishing,

02:14:01.000 --> 02:14:02.999
caught an octopus,

02:14:03.000 --> 02:14:05.999
pulled up seaweed, with seagulls flying around

02:14:06.000 --> 02:14:07.999
and dolphins swimming nearby.

02:14:08.000 --> 02:14:08.999
Hey!

02:14:09.000 --> 02:14:09.999
It's complete chaos.

02:14:10.000 --> 02:14:11.999
Did you slice anything for sashimi?

02:14:12.000 --> 02:14:13.999
I was going to,

02:14:14.000 --> 02:14:18.999
but I'd have to mark the stream adults-only.

02:14:19.000 --> 02:14:21.999
It would be too graphic,

02:14:22.000 --> 02:14:23.999
so I didn't make sashimi.

02:14:24.000 --> 02:14:25.999
Right. You're a prince of the Dragon Palace,

02:14:26.000 --> 02:14:27.999
after all.

02:14:28.000 --> 02:14:28.999
You can't exactly...

02:14:29.000 --> 02:14:32.999
I caught the octopus completely

02:14:33.000 --> 02:14:34.999
and nearly boiled it, but I held back.

02:14:35.000 --> 02:14:36.999
Hey.

02:14:37.000 --> 02:14:38.999
That would be a bit much.

02:14:39.000 --> 02:14:39.999
Exactly.

02:14:40.000 --> 02:14:43.999
But do you even know how to do that?

02:14:44.000 --> 02:14:44.999
Of course not.

02:14:45.000 --> 02:14:46.999
You've never tried?

02:14:47.000 --> 02:14:49.999
No. How many people

02:14:50.000 --> 02:14:51.999
actually know how to prepare an octopus?

02:14:52.000 --> 02:14:54.999
Right. I only know how to eat one.

02:14:55.000 --> 02:14:56.999
Oh. I thought you genuinely

02:14:57.000 --> 02:14:58.999
knew how. I can't do that much.

02:14:59.000 --> 02:15:00.999
I see.

02:15:01.000 --> 02:15:03.999
So why did you call?

02:15:04.000 --> 02:15:06.999
Did I call?

02:15:07.000 --> 02:15:09.999
What's the purpose of this call?

02:15:10.000 --> 02:15:13.999
The purpose? Well,

02:15:14.000 --> 02:15:17.999
whenever Yejun has a birthday stream,

02:15:18.000 --> 02:15:19.999
the members take turns

02:15:20.000 --> 02:15:20.999
calling.

02:15:21.000 --> 02:15:22.999
And confessing our love is basically the rule.

02:15:23.000 --> 02:15:23.999
Yes. It's the official rule now.

02:15:24.000 --> 02:15:25.999
Stamped and confirmed.

02:15:26.000 --> 02:15:28.999
Since it became the rule,

02:15:29.000 --> 02:15:31.999
I thought about what to say

02:15:32.000 --> 02:15:33.999
while working out earlier.

02:15:34.000 --> 02:15:35.999
Honestly, I felt very sorry

02:15:36.000 --> 02:15:37.999
for Yejun today.

02:15:38.000 --> 02:15:41.999
Every member who calls

02:15:42.000 --> 02:15:43.999
says they felt sorry for me.

02:15:44.000 --> 02:15:47.999
But just before the broadcast,

02:15:48.000 --> 02:15:50.999
while we were eating, your dark circles

02:15:51.000 --> 02:15:54.999
were almost below your cheekbones.

02:15:55.000 --> 02:15:57.999
You looked extremely on edge.

02:15:58.000 --> 02:15:59.999
You looked exhausted,

02:16:00.000 --> 02:16:01.999
sweat pouring from your whole body

02:16:02.000 --> 02:16:04.999
as you wiped your head with a towel.

02:16:05.000 --> 02:16:07.999
You were monitoring other things,

02:16:08.000 --> 02:16:09.999
checking details, preparing the birthday stream,

02:16:10.000 --> 02:16:12.999
practicing choreography and filming.

02:16:13.000 --> 02:16:15.999
You didn't get to play even once today.

02:16:16.000 --> 02:16:18.999
Some days are like that.

02:16:19.000 --> 02:16:21.999
Still, seeing you that exhausted

02:16:22.000 --> 02:16:23.999
honestly made my heart ache today.

02:16:24.000 --> 02:16:24.999
It really did.

02:16:25.000 --> 02:16:28.999
Thank you for making me feel

02:16:29.000 --> 02:16:30.999
as though you're watching over me.

02:16:31.000 --> 02:16:33.999
Thank you for saying that.

02:16:34.000 --> 02:16:36.999
My heart really hurt

02:16:37.000 --> 02:16:38.999
for you today.

