02:18:29.000 --> 02:18:30.999
I always learn from you.

02:18:31.000 --> 02:18:32.999
Thank you. I learn from the members too.

02:18:33.000 --> 02:18:35.999
I'm so grateful

02:18:36.000 --> 02:18:36.999
