02:20:41.000 --> 02:20:43.999
If I start now, I'll get sick.

02:20:44.000 --> 02:20:44.999
Right.

02:20:45.000 --> 02:20:46.999
My condition hasn't been great lately.

02:20:47.000 --> 02:20:47.999
Okay.

02:20:48.000 --> 02:20:50.999
Don't get sick. But not exercising

02:20:51.000 --> 02:20:52.999
and being weak may be why you get sick.

02:20:53.000 --> 02:20:54.999
I think so too, honestly.

02:20:55.000 --> 02:20:57.999
Right. Without exercise, I'm always drained,

02:20:58.000 --> 02:20:59.999
