02:21:24.000 --> 02:21:24.999
Yeah.

02:21:25.000 --> 02:21:26.999
I'll lead by example.

02:21:27.000 --> 02:21:28.999
Okay, that's cool.

02:21:29.000 --> 02:21:29.999
Okay.

02:21:30.000 --> 02:21:31.999
Let's go running too.

02:21:32.000 --> 02:21:34.999
I'm thinking of taking up running.

02:21:35.000 --> 02:21:37.999
