02:21:40.000 --> 02:21:40.999
I went out and ran.

02:21:41.000 --> 02:21:42.999
Okay. Then all five of us will run together.

02:21:43.000 --> 02:21:44.999
That's the plan.

02:21:45.000 --> 02:21:47.999
Okay. Understood.

02:21:48.000 --> 02:21:48.999
Okay. See you tomorrow.

02:21:49.000 --> 02:21:51.999
Okay. Happy belated birthday.

02:21:52.000 --> 02:21:52.999
Yeah.

02:21:53.000 --> 02:21:54.999
Enjoy the remaining time

02:21:55.000 --> 02:21:55.999
